  "content": {
    "id": "nr-p59-q21",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "A tower is built on flat ground.\n\nThree tourists, $A$, $B$ and $C$ are observing the tower from ground level. $A$ is due north of the tower, $C$ is due east and $B$ is on the line of sight from $A$ to $C$ and between them.\n\nThe angles of elevation of the top of the tower from $A$, $B$ and $C$ are $26^\\circ$, $28^\\circ$ and $30^\\circ$, respectively.\n\nWhat is the bearing of $B$ from the tower?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [
      {
        "id": "nr-p59-q21-diagram1",
        "role": "question",
        "format": "tikz",
        "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"Source page 59, nr-p59-q21-diagram1\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\\large}]\n% mathsmap-standard-palette 2026-09-11\n\\definecolor{ink}{HTML}{24282D}\n\\definecolor{blue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\definecolor{red}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\definecolor{green}{HTML}{4F9B63}\n\\definecolor{orange}{HTML}{EF8B2C}\n\\definecolor{tableLabel}{HTML}{D3E8FC}\n\\definecolor{housegrid}{HTML}{CCCCCC}\n\\definecolor{skipped}{HTML}{C7C7C7}\n\\definecolor{housemuted}{HTML}{777777}\n\\definecolor{blueFill}{HTML}{D4E8FF}\n\\definecolor{redFill}{HTML}{FCDFE1}\n\\definecolor{greenFill}{HTML}{DCEBE0}\n\\definecolor{orangeFill}{HTML}{FCE8D5}\n\\usetikzlibrary{calc,angles,quotes,arrows.meta}\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (O) at (0,0);\n\\coordinate (T) at (0,3.4);\n\\coordinate (A) at (3.3,1.6);\n\\coordinate (C) at (2.45,-3.0);\n\\coordinate (B) at ($(A)!0.4!(C)$);\n\\fill[housegrid] (O)--(A)--(C)--cycle;\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt,black] (O)--(A);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt,black] (A)--(C);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt,black] (C)--(O);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt,black] (O)--(B);\n\\fill[housemuted] ($(O)+(-0.035,0)$)--($(O)+(0.035,0)$)--($(T)+(0.035,0)$)--($(T)+(-0.035,0)$)--cycle;\n\\node[left] at ($(O)!0.5!(T)$) {$h$};\n\\draw[dashed,line width=0.4pt,black] (T)--(A);\n\\draw[dashed,line width=0.4pt,black] (T)--(B);\n\\draw[dashed,line width=0.4pt,black] (T)--(C);\n\\pic[draw,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=1.02cm,angle eccentricity=0.68,\"$26^\\circ$\"] {angle=T--A--O};\n\\pic[draw,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=1.20cm,angle eccentricity=0.70,\"$28^\\circ$\"] {angle=T--B--O};\n\\pic[draw,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=1.90cm,angle eccentricity=1.3,\"$30^\\circ$\"] {angle=T--C--O};\n\\node[left] at (O) {$O$};\n\\node[above] at (T) {$T$};\n\\node[right] at (A) {$A$};\n\\node[right] at (B) {$B$};\n\\node[below] at (C) {$C$};\n\\draw[-{Stealth},line width=0.5pt] ($(O)!1.18!(A)$)--($(O)!1.45!(A)$) node[right] {North};\n\\draw[-{Stealth},line width=0.5pt] ($(O)!1.15!(C)$)--($(O)!1.40!(C)$) node[right] {East};\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-diagram-colours=\"1\" data-diagram-kind=\"geometry\" data-diagram-base=\"\" data-diagram-semantic-palette=\"\" data-diagram-semantic-reference=\"Source page 59, nr-p59-q21-diagram1\" data-diagram-semantic-reasons=\"\"/>}\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
        "src": null,
        "widthMm": 71,
        "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
        "overlayOf": null,
